          {
            "content": "Sentiment never gets to outrank somebody's lungs or skin. If that lantern started leaking fuel or venting fumes in a way no honest repair could fix, I would take it out of service, keep the brass body where I can see it, and carry a headlamp without pretending that was a small loss.",
